 "frozen": [
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "信息使用**。实测中 20 日动量策略就是这种情况——训练段 skill +4.45%，",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "fa3e7d271cacc44b"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "验证段 -4.19%，符号翻转。",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "972f8958adff3dcd"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "真值的 0.817 倍，`n_eff` 因此被系统性放大 1.5 倍：同一个门槛 30 在旧",
   "where": "_mean_se_lcb",
   "sha": "e56769e831b6c337"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "在这里得到 1，而不是 NW 噪声给出的 11–55。",
   "where": "_mean_se_lcb",
   "sha": "81aaaf9af8c777a9"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "约 1.8 个独立样本，报 17 仍然高估一个数量级。而且 `n_eff_nw` 随 window",
   "where": "_identifiable_sample",
   "sha": "06f7227a762d4446"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "上限是 `3k/(lag+1)` 而不是 `k/(lag+1)`——低估 3 倍。传了日历就用真实跨度，",
   "where": "_identifiable_sample",
   "sha": "13d18cf429dd2c3b"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "多报了 3 倍，而门禁想要的方向恰恰是把发卡变稀疏。",
   "where": "_not_testable_remedy",
   "sha": "973e954f9250c603"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "**问题一（`verdict`，现行语义）**：这个 p 比「无信息常数 0.5」好吗？",
   "where": "walk_forward",
   "sha": "9bda77660cfea5e2"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "为什么必须分开：若 p 接近常数，问题一有闭式解 `skill = 1 - 4p(1-p)`——",
   "where": "walk_forward",
   "sha": "dddc0fa0c2fd8ebe"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "命中率 15% ⇒ +49%，28% ⇒ +19%。这个数字只说明「胜率离 50% 有多远」，",
   "where": "walk_forward",
   "sha": "baf2387d13f67961"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "`d` 的 DEFF 的近似上界。默认关闭：一张卡存 300–900 个整数会撑大契约，",
   "where": "walk_forward",
   "sha": "cd5db133b776cb80"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/pwin.py",
   "text": "实测 abs 口径在 window=250 下改善 +0.00011、下界 +0.00003，若只按符号判定",
   "where": "comment#4",
   "sha": "83018d686f2f2fd4"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "| `median` | `ret > 同日全市场中位数` | **精确 0.5** | ≈ pick 数 |",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "b6d39fb1728eec58"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "的日间 sd = 21.4%，p0 的 95%CI 约 ±12%（用 12 个起点）到 ±2.3%（用 223 个）。",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "0501bae86777d935"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "把 3 万个观测当独立样本会把精度高估 30 倍以上。",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "17c97084b4a6873b"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "（同日 20 个 pick 的日胜率 sd 11.1% ≈ 独立假设的 11.2%）。代价是它衡量的是",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "6502486a0a403de4"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "等于宣称「零误差」（iid 压力测试里 n=250 有 2.5% 的重复踩到）。",
   "where": "hac_lcb",
   "sha": "e8fec38a7e0895eb"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "下界仍然偏乐观。这种情形下该看的是 `n_eff`（可能只有 1–2），不是下界。",
   "where": "hac_lcb",
   "sha": "be2c3a3909d42e56"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "抽样会给出 0.56–1.26 倍的方差膨胀（实测 n=17 抽 5 次）。这种情形退回",
   "where": "effective_sample",
   "sha": "b740171744599d14"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "因此得到 1，而不是 NW 噪声给出的 11–55。",
   "where": "effective_sample",
   "sha": "1049eb4c52fd692f"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "LRV_hat → (2/3 + 1/(3H²))·LRV = 267/400·LRV = 0.6675·LRV (H = 20)",
   "where": "comment#7",
   "sha": "9769a89a9806b8b6"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "也就是 `se` 恒为真值的 `sqrt(267/400) ≈ 0.817` 倍（`sqrt(2/3) = 0.8165` 只是",
   "where": "comment#7",
   "sha": "5a29451f3bef6aa3"
  },
  {
   "file": "backend/app/decision/settle.py",
   "text": "更重的那一端；`n_eff = n·(se_iid/se)²` 被同一份偏差放大 1.5 倍。",
   "where": "comment#7",
   "sha": "16e02b9128286a85"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_power.py",
   "text": "门槛与教科书一致（实测名义 5% 下 size=2–4%）。",
   "where": "_t_cusum",
   "sha": "af8652cbfc1b676d"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_power.py",
   "text": "`>0.30`——因为约束不在刻度，在「对 780 个候选变点取最大值」这个动作本身",
   "where": "_t_cusum",
   "sha": "34470fa3fe6d69dd"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_size.py",
   "text": "变点要 20–30pp 才过」。但那次有三个缺口，使它不能当验收读数：",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "231bb5e2d7a2df9a"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_size.py",
   "text": "自相关）和日内 pick 同向，iid 零分布会把 `se` 低估 3–5 倍，于是 size 看起",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "d46224c752a3938a"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_size.py",
   "text": "§9.26 的注释又把它开方读成「3.2pp 的胜率抬升」；这两个读法从来没有在同一个",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "93164e45a53ff413"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_size.py",
   "text": "实验里对上过。本脚本把 `sqrt(mde_incremental − 0.001)` 与**实测 80% 功率点**",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "9656ca83ef43e848"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_size.py",
   "text": "3. **PASS 率只在 2–3 个 a 上取过点**。如果检出力对 a 非单调（`d_i` 的方差随",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "286cc84ed2bf6298"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_incremental_size.py",
   "text": "a80 power = 80% 的最小 a（线性插值）",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "94e87562abf8e96f"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_mde_matrix.py",
   "text": "MDE = 2.486·se_块；门 200bp（探索）/ 176bp（`CONFIRM_GATE`，确认段）。",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "09d6edc5b04d1776"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_mde_matrix.py",
   "text": "- 250 天窗的 MDE **实测**（窗内 8–10 个起点取中位），不用开方外推；",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "e1ddaa6a7ae326e3"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_mde_matrix.py",
   "text": "- 行业与股本是当前快照，跨 2025-06 起的回测有前视（与 `probe_neutral.py`",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "5bae8dc9d8fd255c"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_mde_matrix.py",
   "text": "250→80 的开方外推在 §6.3/§6.6 上已经对不上（外推 148.8 / 实测 122.7），",
   "where": "comment#3",
   "sha": "1f9680ec8cc694ff"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_mde_truth.py",
   "text": "会高估 sd。实测这一项在 ρ=0.82 时只有方差的 1%，所以 1.00x 的比值成立；",
   "where": "simulate",
   "sha": "7eca7f1ec93bcda8"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_net_diff.py",
   "text": "`b/n=0.25` 已经越过循环块重抽的适用边界：重抽均值贴着全样本均值，se 塌下去",
   "where": "block_table",
   "sha": "f0e9e3a504f853b7"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_net_diff.py",
   "text": "（reversal 84.7→56.9），而 high 因为带趋势反而升到 155.3。**同一列上方向都",
   "where": "block_table",
   "sha": "e904e5ba59971b1b"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_net_diff.py",
   "text": "量。若两者加上宽度带之后跨过 200bp，那一档在确认段就是不可判定的——",
   "where": "budget_table",
   "sha": "25a9d5a99c926a6d"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_neutral.py",
   "text": "行业 × 规模中性化：+185bp 里有多少是「选了哪个行业」而不是「选了什么股」。",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "9fa7a87108d19e48"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_neutral.py",
   "text": "银行、公用事业、高速公路这些「天生低换手」的行业，那 +185bp 里就混着行业",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "2f6eefa30cf9fdd4"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_neutral.py",
   "text": "2. **回退率**：格子内样本 < 8 只时退回行业内中位数。回退率高说明 90×3 的",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "f771d18c1634a31d"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_neutral.py",
   "text": "- 行业分类是 **2026-11-05 的快照**（同花顺一级，5,579 只）。回测跨 2025-06",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "215e7fcaec569813"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_neutral.py",
   "text": "小数点后的事：`fwd` 右偏，均值 − 中位数 ≈ +200bp，而组合的 P&L 是均值。",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "badc55c744d692c0"
  },
  {
   "file": "scripts/probe_neutral.py",
   "text": "v11 的 §6.1 有一行 `146`（low×格内，MDE@250），它由 128×√(325/250) 外推而",
   "where": "<module>",
   "sha": "7d94e9a075ac563e"
  },
